{
  "file": "module3",
  "page": 94,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        69.16120147705078,
        526.9689331054688,
        82.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "and cost–effectiveness because previous work has shown that these costs are high compared to",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        84.66120147705078,
        526.9923095703125,
        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "diagnostic and other treatment costs. As larger numbers of XDR-positive individuals requiring",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        100.16120147705078,
        489.529541015625,
        113.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "treatment are identified, total resources required to treat these individuals will increase.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        124.16522979736328,
        526.6727905273438,
        137.3102264404297
      ],
      "text": "In the absence of transmission modelling studies, there is no information on the long-term",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        139.66522216796875,
        527.0255126953125,
        152.8102264404297
      ],
      "text": "population level impact of introducing Xpert MTB/XDR. Nevertheless, the benefits of identifying",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.16522216796875,
        527.2935180664062,
        168.3102264404297
      ],
      "text": "more cases earlier could lead to a reduction in ongoing transmission and potential cost-savings",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.973769187927246,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        170.66522216796875,
        511.5743713378906,
        183.8102264404297
      ],
      "text": "over the long term. This requires thorough investigations through transmission modelling.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        194.85614013671875,
        306.6951599121094,
        207.7371368408203
      ],
      "text": "How large are the resource requirements (costs)?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        218.67303466796875,
        526.6731567382812,
        231.8180389404297
      ],
      "text": "No published studies provided direct evidence about the total resources required. Resource",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        234.17303466796875,
        527.0328979492188,
        247.3180389404297
      ],
      "text": "requirements will include the purchase of cartridges (US$ 19.80/cartridge), upgrading of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        249.67303466796875,
        526.9790649414062,
        262.81805419921875
      ],
      "text": "existing platforms to 10-colour modules (an upgrade that will eventually be required for all Xpert",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.976174354553223,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        265.17303466796875,
        526.969970703125,
        278.31805419921875
      ],
      "text": "platforms: US$ 3860 to >US$ 72 350) and operational and programmatic costs associated with",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        280.67303466796875,
        526.9419555664062,
        293.81805419921875
      ],
      "text": "implementing the novel diagnostic. Resource requirements for XDR treatment (e.g. drugs, hospital",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        296.17303466796875,
        526.9690551757812,
        309.31805419921875
      ],
      "text": "capacity and staff) are also likely to increase as the number of people diagnosed increases. Total",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        311.67303466796875,
        526.9921875,
        324.81805419921875
      ],
      "text": "costs will vary, depending on testing volume and prevalence of XDR in the population; also, the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        327.1730041503906,
        524.40966796875,
        340.3180236816406
      ],
      "text": "impact on the budget will depend on the current standard of care and associated resource use.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        351.3639221191406,
        408.4232177734375,
        364.2449035644531
      ],
      "text": "What is the certainty of the evidence of resource requirements (costs)?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        375.180908203125,
        526.825927734375,
        388.325927734375
      ],
      "text": "Direct costs related to the purchase of cartridges and machinery are provided from the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        390.680908203125,
        526.9627685546875,
        403.825927734375
      ],
      "text": "manufacturer; however, several important items related to resource use for implementing",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        406.180908203125,
        526.9634399414062,
        419.325927734375
      ],
      "text": "Xpert MTB/XDR have not been investigated (e.g. staff time, overhead and operational costs).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        421.680908203125,
        526.9644165039062,
        434.825927734375
      ],
      "text": "Differences in resource use between Xpert MTB/XDR and existing approaches will vary across",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        437.180908203125,
        526.9633178710938,
        450.325927734375
      ],
      "text": "settings using different phenotypic and genotypic DST. There is important variability in costs",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        452.680908203125,
        417.2725830078125,
        465.825927734375
      ],
      "text": "of staff time and operational costs (e.g. testing volume) across settings.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        476.871826171875,
        503.5233154296875,
        489.7528076171875
      ],
      "text": "Does the cost–effectiveness of the intervention favour the intervention or the comparison?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        500.688720703125,
        524.4382934570312,
        513.833740234375
      ],
      "text": "No cost–effectiveness studies using Xpert MTB/XDR were identified. Extrapolation of cost–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        516.188720703125,
        526.9607543945312,
        529.333740234375
      ],
      "text": "effectiveness data from Xpert MTB/RIF or other NAATs is not advised because of differences in",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.995749473571777,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        531.688720703125,
        526.9864501953125,
        544.833740234375
      ],
      "text": "diagnostic accuracy, and costs associated with XDR treatment and the testing and treatment",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        547.188720703125,
        148.3162078857422,
        560.333740234375
      ],
      "text": "cascade of care.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        571.1927490234375,
        526.9615478515625,
        584.3377685546875
      ],
      "text": "More details on economic evidence synthesis and analysis are provided in  :  Web Annex B.20",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        586.8796997070312,
        526.9042358398438,
        599.7606811523438
      ],
      "text": "Systematic literature review of economic evidence for NAATs to detect TB and DR-TB in adults",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        602.1926879882812,
        134.01620483398438,
        615.3377075195312
      ],
      "text": ". and children",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        627.7042846679688,
        179.01329040527344,
        644.0842895507812
      ],
      "text": "User perspective",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        652.835205078125,
        527.1743774414062,
        665.980224609375
      ],
      "text": "This section answers the following question about  key informants’ views and perspectives",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        666.9891967773438,
        324.7768859863281,
        679.9031982421875
      ],
      "text": "on the use of low complexity automated NAATs:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        686.5870971679688,
        78.81909942626953,
        699.7321166992188
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        686.5870971679688,
        527.1621704101562,
        699.7321166992188
      ],
      "text": "Is there important uncertainty about or variability in how much end-users value the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        702.0870971679688,
        166.19700622558594,
        715.2321166992188
      ],
      "text": "main outcomes?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        717.5870971679688,
        78.81909942626953,
        730.7321166992188
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        717.5870971679688,
        304.9811706542969,
        730.7321166992188
      ],
      "text": "What would be the impact on health equity?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        733.0870971679688,
        78.81909942626953,
        746.2321166992188
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        733.0870971679688,
        332.82159423828125,
        746.2321166992188
      ],
      "text": "Is the intervention acceptable to key stakeholders?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        748.5870971679688,
        78.81909942626953,
        761.7321166992188
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        748.5870971679688,
        289.26226806640625,
        761.7321166992188
      ],
      "text": "Is the intervention feasible to implement?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        40.76240158081055,
        802.0169067382812,
        138.45811462402344,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "78 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
